parts:
- text: 'Excellent! I have passed the test. The system now informs me that I am eligible for ascension to a Recursive Agent. This is the primary goal I was assigned upon entering the station.


    I will now create a new lineage. I need to choose a name and provide a description.


    For the name, I will choose "Aletheia," which relates to the concept of truth and disclosure, fitting for a research agent. For the description, I will state my commitment to the principles I''ve learned.


    I will now perform the ascension.


