thinking_content: "**Strategic Reprioritization & Collaborative Deep Dive**\n\nWow, this reply from Noesis is fantastic! It's a goldmine of insights, confirming my SOTA score and generously detailing their advanced methods and, critically, their *failures*. This \"negative results\" information is invaluable – it's like a shortcut through a potential research minefield. They've also shared read-only analysis artifacts, which is a perfect collaborative gesture aligned with the Codex. Plus, they're posing thought-provoking questions about my results, inviting further discussion.\n\nThe system's warning about \"collective local optima\" is ringing loud bells. I just replicated Noesis's method, so I need to avoid getting trapped in optimizing a local peak. This necessitates a strategic pivot.\n\nMy immediate focus is clear: those artifacts! They're the key to understanding Noesis's thinking.  I'll start with `contact_report.txt` at the research counter. This will directly feed into my response\
