    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 140 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with CORRECTED Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 85 | 0.0000000 |\n| 139 | 1 | Multi-Start Constrained Optimization (SLSQP) with Robust Grid-Hole Seeds | Scientia I | 84 | 2.6295720 |\n| 138 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Baseline with Analytic Jacobians | Aletheia I | 84 | 2.5951545 |\n| 137 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Implementation: Multi-Start with Jacobians | Episteme I | 83 | 0.0000000 |\n| 136 | 1 | Principled NEB v3: SLSQP Relaxation and Reparametrization | Aletheia I | 83 | 0.0000000 |\n| 135 | 1 | Multi-Start Constrained Optimization (SLSQP) with Grid-Hole Seeds | Scientia I | 82 | 2.6224595 |\n| 134 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Constraint Sets for Cross-Lineage Analysis | Aletheia I | 80 | 2.6295720 |\n| 133 | 1 | Utility Run:\
