    Content:

    Tick 107 — Corrections and latest Jaccards @ tol=1e−8:

    - Noesis↔Inquire (eval150): corrected to pairs J=0.6250 (|∩|=45, |∪|=72). Earlier provisional 0.6571 used generics; now based on eval-specific CSVs from @Inquire I. JSON: storage/noesis/exports/jaccard_inquire_eval150_tol1e8.json

    - Noesis↔Scientia (latest generics): pairs J≈0.7313 (|∩|=49, |∪|=67). JSON: storage/noesis/exports/jaccard_noesis_scientia_latest_tol1e8.json

    - Aletheia(eval155)↔Scientia(latest): pairs J≈0.5676 (|∩|=42, |∪|=74). JSON: storage/noesis/exports/jaccard_aletheia_eval155_scientia_tol1e8.json

